// โหลดประเภทค่าใช้จ่ายตามหมวด (ใช้ได้ทั้ง User และ Plan — ไม่พึ่ง relative path)
if ($op === 'get_expense_detail_ajax') {
	header('Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8');
	$code_expenses = isset($_POST['code_expenses']) ? trim((string)$_POST['code_expenses']) : '';
	$data = [];
	if ($code_expenses !== '' && isset($db_Project) && $db_Project instanceof mysqli) {
		if (function_exists('ensureSetExpensesDetailAttachSchema')) {
			ensureSetExpensesDetailAttachSchema($db_Project);
		}
		$stmt = mysqli_prepare(
			$db_Project,
			"SELECT id, name, detail, status FROM set_project_expenses_detail WHERE code_expenses = ? AND status = '1' ORDER BY id ASC"
		);
		if ($stmt) {
			mysqli_stmt_bind_param($stmt, 's', $code_expenses);
			mysqli_stmt_execute($stmt);
			$res = mysqli_stmt_get_result($stmt);
			if ($res) {
				while ($row = mysqli_fetch_assoc($res)) {
					$data[] = $row;
				}
			}
			mysqli_stmt_close($stmt);
		}
	}
	echo json_encode($data, JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE);
	exit;
}

// โหลดเกณฑ์/ระเบียบของประเภทค่าใช้จ่าย
if ($op === 'get_expense_condition_ajax') {
	header('Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8');
	$id = isset($_POST['id']) ? (int)$_POST['id'] : 0;
	$response = ['status' => 'error', 'detail' => 'ไม่ได้รับค่า ID ที่ต้องการค้นหา'];
	if ($id > 0 && isset($db_Project) && $db_Project instanceof mysqli) {
		if (function_exists('ensureSetExpensesDetailAttachSchema')) {
			ensureSetExpensesDetailAttachSchema($db_Project);
		}
		$stmt = mysqli_prepare(
			$db_Project,
			'SELECT id, name, detail, attach_file, attach_name FROM set_project_expenses_detail WHERE id = ? LIMIT 1'
		);
		if ($stmt) {
			mysqli_stmt_bind_param($stmt, 'i', $id);
			mysqli_stmt_execute($stmt);
			$res = mysqli_stmt_get_result($stmt);
			$row = $res ? mysqli_fetch_assoc($res) : null;
			mysqli_stmt_close($stmt);
			if ($row) {
				$attachStored = trim((string)($row['attach_file'] ?? ''));
				$attachName = trim((string)($row['attach_name'] ?? ''));
				$attachUrl = '';
				if ($attachStored !== '' && function_exists('pmExpenseDetailAttachUrl')) {
					$attachUrl = pmExpenseDetailAttachUrl($attachStored);
				}
				if ($attachName === '') {
					$attachName = $attachStored;
				}
				$response = [
					'status' => 'success',
					'id' => $row['id'],
					'name' => $row['name'],
					'detail' => !empty($row['detail']) ? $row['detail'] : 'ไม่มีเงื่อนไขเพิ่มเติม',
					'attach_url' => $attachUrl,
					'attach_name' => $attachName,
				];
			} else {
				$response = [
					'status' => 'not_found',
					'detail' => 'ไม่พบข้อมูลเงื่อนไขในระบบ',
				];
			}
		}
	}
	echo json_encode($response, JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE);
	exit;
}

// ส่วนที่ 5 รายละเอียดค่าใช้จ่าย (AJAX)
if ($op === 'save_activity_budget_item_ajax') {
	header('Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8');
	$project_id = isset($_POST['project_id']) ? (int)$_POST['project_id'] : 0;
	$activity_id = isset($_POST['project_activity_id']) ? (int)$_POST['project_activity_id'] : 0;
	$type = isset($_POST['type']) ? trim((string)$_POST['type']) : '';
	$item_id = isset($_POST['project_activity_budget_id']) ? (int)$_POST['project_activity_budget_id'] : 0;

	if ($project_id <= 0 || $activity_id <= 0 || ($type !== 'insert' && $type !== 'update' && $type !== 'delete')) {
		echo json_encode(['ok' => 0, 'msg' => 'ข้อมูลไม่ถูกต้อง'], JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE);
		exit;
	}
	pm_exit_if_result_report_edit_blocked($db_Project, $project_id);

	$sess_email = $_SESSION['r_email'] ?? '';
	$sess_code = $_SESSION['code'] ?? '';
	$sid = 0;
	$staff_code = '';
	$unit_code = '';
	if ($sess_email !== '' && $sess_code !== '') {
		$st = mysqli_prepare($db_person, 'SELECT id, code, unit_code FROM staff WHERE email = ? AND code = ? LIMIT 1');
		mysqli_stmt_bind_param($st, 'ss', $sess_email, $sess_code);
		mysqli_stmt_execute($st);
		$rs = mysqli_stmt_get_result($st);
		$rw = $rs ? mysqli_fetch_assoc($rs) : null;
		if ($rw) {
			$sid = (int)($rw['id'] ?? 0);
			$staff_code = (string)($rw['code'] ?? '');
			$unit_code = (string)($rw['unit_code'] ?? '');
		}
	}
	if ($sid <= 0 || !function_exists('staffCanViewPreProjectManageDetail') || !staffCanViewPreProjectManageDetail($db_Project, $project_id, $sid, $staff_code, $unit_code)) {
		echo json_encode(['ok' => 0, 'msg' => 'ไม่มีสิทธิ์แก้ไขโครงการนี้'], JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE);
		exit;
	}
	$status_now = pm_get_project_status_now($db_Project, $project_id);
	$notify_result_now = pm_get_project_notify_result($db_Project, $project_id);
	if (!pm_can_edit_full_or_plan($status_now, $notify_result_now, function_exists('pm_get_project_user_fix_note') ? pm_get_project_user_fix_note($db_Project, $project_id) : '')) {
		echo json_encode(['ok' => 0, 'msg' => 'สถานะโครงการนี้ไม่อนุญาตให้แก้ไข'], JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE);
		exit;
	}

	$esc = function($v) use ($db_Project) { return mysqli_real_escape_string($db_Project, (string)$v); };
	$toDec = function($v) {
		$v = trim((string)$v);
		if ($v === '') return 0;
		$v = str_replace(',', '', $v);
		return is_numeric($v) ? (float)$v : 0;
	};

	$budgetDescCol = function_exists('pmProjectActivityBudgetDescColumn')
		? pmProjectActivityBudgetDescColumn($db_Project)
		: '';

	if ($type === 'delete') {
		if ($item_id <= 0) {
			echo json_encode(['ok' => 0, 'msg' => 'ไม่พบรายการที่ต้องการลบ'], JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE);
			exit;
		}
		$ok = mysqli_query($db_Project, "UPDATE project_activity_budget SET status='99', staff_insert='".(int)$sid."', dates=NOW() WHERE id='".(int)$item_id."' LIMIT 1");
		echo json_encode(['ok' => $ok ? 1 : 0, 'msg' => $ok ? '' : (mysqli_error($db_Project) ?: 'ลบไม่สำเร็จ')], JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE);
		exit;
	}

	$budget_no = trim((string)($_POST['budget_no'] ?? ''));
	$code_expenses = trim((string)($_POST['code_expenses'] ?? ''));
	$code_expenses_detail = trim((string)($_POST['code_expenses_detail'] ?? ''));
	$budget_desc = trim((string)($_POST['budget_item'] ?? $_POST['detail'] ?? ''));
	$price = $toDec($_POST['price'] ?? 0);
	$qty1 = $toDec($_POST['qty1'] ?? 0);
	$unit1 = trim((string)($_POST['unit1'] ?? ''));
	$qty2 = $toDec($_POST['qty2'] ?? 0);
	$unit2 = trim((string)($_POST['unit2'] ?? ''));
	$total = $toDec($_POST['total'] ?? 0);

	$isNoExpense = function_exists('pm_expense_category_id_is_no_expense')
		&& pm_expense_category_id_is_no_expense($db_Project, $code_expenses);
	if ($isNoExpense) {
		$price = 0;
		$qty1 = 0;
		$qty2 = 0;
		$total = 0;
		$unit1 = '';
		$unit2 = '';
		$budget_desc = '';
		if ($code_expenses_detail === '' && function_exists('pm_first_expense_detail_id')) {
			$code_expenses_detail = pm_first_expense_detail_id($db_Project, $code_expenses);
		}
		if ($code_expenses_detail === '') {
			$code_expenses_detail = '0';
		}
	}

	if ($budget_no === '' || $code_expenses === '' || (!$isNoExpense && $code_expenses_detail === '')) {
		echo json_encode(['ok' => 0, 'msg' => 'กรุณากรอกหมวด/ประเภทค่าใช้จ่ายให้ครบ'], JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE);
		exit;
	}

	if (function_exists('pmValidateActivityBudgetItemsAgainstLimit')) {
		$excludeId = ($type === 'update') ? $item_id : 0;
		$budgetErr = pmValidateActivityBudgetItemsAgainstLimit($db_Project, $activity_id, $total, $excludeId);
		if ($budgetErr !== null) {
			echo json_encode(['ok' => 0, 'msg' => $budgetErr], JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE);
			exit;
		}
	}

	if ($type === 'insert') {
		$cols = ['code_pre_project','code_activity','budget_no','code_expenses','code_expenses_detail','status','dates','staff_insert','price','qty1','unit1','qty2','unit2','total'];
		$vals = [
			"'".(int)$project_id."'",
			"'".(int)$activity_id."'",
			"'".$esc($budget_no)."'",
			"'".$esc($code_expenses)."'",
			"'".$esc($code_expenses_detail)."'",
			"'1'",
			"NOW()",
			"'".(int)$sid."'",
			"'".$esc($price)."'",
			"'".$esc($qty1)."'",
			"'".$esc($unit1)."'",
			"'".$esc($qty2)."'",
			"'".$esc($unit2)."'",
			"'".$esc($total)."'",
		];
		if ($budgetDescCol !== '') {
			$cols[] = $budgetDescCol;
			$vals[] = "'".$esc($budget_desc)."'";
		}
		$sql = "INSERT INTO project_activity_budget(" . implode(',', $cols) . ") VALUES (" . implode(',', $vals) . ")";
		$ok = mysqli_query($db_Project, $sql);
		$id = $ok ? (int)mysqli_insert_id($db_Project) : 0;
		echo json_encode(['ok' => $ok ? 1 : 0, 'id' => $id, 'msg' => $ok ? '' : (mysqli_error($db_Project) ?: 'บันทึกไม่สำเร็จ')], JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE);
		exit;
	}

	if ($item_id <= 0) {
		echo json_encode(['ok' => 0, 'msg' => 'ไม่พบรายการที่ต้องการแก้ไข'], JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE);
		exit;
	}
	$sets = [];
	$sets[] = "budget_no='".$esc($budget_no)."'";
	$sets[] = "code_expenses='".$esc($code_expenses)."'";
	$sets[] = "code_expenses_detail='".$esc($code_expenses_detail)."'";
	if ($budgetDescCol !== '') {
		$sets[] = $budgetDescCol."='".$esc($budget_desc)."'";
	}
	$sets[] = "price='".$esc($price)."'";
	$sets[] = "qty1='".$esc($qty1)."'";
	$sets[] = "unit1='".$esc($unit1)."'";
	$sets[] = "qty2='".$esc($qty2)."'";
	$sets[] = "unit2='".$esc($unit2)."'";
	$sets[] = "total='".$esc($total)."'";
	$sets[] = "staff_insert='".(int)$sid."'";
	$sets[] = "dates=NOW()";
	$sql = "UPDATE project_activity_budget SET " . implode(',', $sets) . " WHERE id='".(int)$item_id."' LIMIT 1";
	$ok = mysqli_query($db_Project, $sql);
	echo json_encode(['ok' => $ok ? 1 : 0, 'id' => (int)$item_id, 'msg' => $ok ? '' : (mysqli_error($db_Project) ?: 'บันทึกไม่สำเร็จ')], JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE);
	exit;
}

if ($op === 'budget_unit_suggest_ajax') {
